* Alternative: a different comparator, latch and encoder from the reference.
* - ladder of 8 x 400 ohm with 2 pF tap decoupling
* - double-tail dynamic comparators (input stage clocked by ck, latch stage by its complement ckb), with 10 fF on
*   the stage-1 nodes so the latch's reset devices do not kick them above vdd
* - NAND SR latches behind equal inverters
* - thermometer -> one-hot (active low) -> binary through four-input NANDs built from two NAND2 and an OR

.subckt dt_inv a y vdd vss
MP y a vdd vdd pfet_03v3 w=3u l=0.28u
MN y a vss vss nfet_03v3 w=1.5u l=0.28u
.ends dt_inv

.subckt dt_clk a ck ckb vdd vss
* clk pin -> small inverter -> ck driver; ckb from a second driver on ck
MP1 m a vdd vdd pfet_03v3 w=3u l=0.28u
MN1 m a vss vss nfet_03v3 w=1.5u l=0.28u
MP2 ck m vdd vdd pfet_03v3 w=4u l=0.28u m=4
MN2 ck m vss vss nfet_03v3 w=4u l=0.28u m=2
MP3 ckb ck vdd vdd pfet_03v3 w=4u l=0.28u m=4
MN3 ckb ck vss vss nfet_03v3 w=4u l=0.28u m=2
.ends dt_clk

.subckt dt_nand2 a b y vdd vss
MP1 y a vdd vdd pfet_03v3 w=3u l=0.28u
MP2 y b vdd vdd pfet_03v3 w=3u l=0.28u
MN1 y a nx vss nfet_03v3 w=3u l=0.28u
MN2 nx b vss vss nfet_03v3 w=3u l=0.28u
.ends dt_nand2

.subckt dt_nand4 a b c d y vdd vss
* !(a.b.c.d) as NAND2(a,b) and NAND2(c,d) into an OR (NOR2 + inverter): two-high NMOS stacks at most
XA a b x1 vdd vss dt_nand2
XB c d x2 vdd vss dt_nand2
MP1 z x1 pz vdd pfet_03v3 w=6u l=0.28u
MP2 pz x2 vdd vdd pfet_03v3 w=6u l=0.28u
MN1 z x1 vss vss nfet_03v3 w=1.5u l=0.28u
MN2 z x2 vss vss nfet_03v3 w=1.5u l=0.28u
XO z y vdd vss dt_inv
.ends dt_nand4

.subckt dt_comp ck ckb vinp vinn up dn vdd vss
* stage 1: fn/fp precharged high while ck is low, discharged by the input pair while ck is high; a weak
* tail makes them fall over about a nanosecond, so the latch is enabled while they still carry the decision
MT1 t1 ck vss vss nfet_03v3 w=1u l=0.93u
MIP fn vinp t1 vss nfet_03v3 w=4u l=0.28u
MIN fp vinn t1 vss nfet_03v3 w=4u l=0.28u
MPN fn ck vdd vdd pfet_03v3 w=2u l=0.28u
MPP fp ck vdd vdd pfet_03v3 w=2u l=0.28u
* stage 2: latch powered through ckb; up/dn held low while fn/fp are high, released as they fall
MT2 t2 ckb vdd vdd pfet_03v3 w=4u l=0.28u m=4
MLP1 up dn t2 vdd pfet_03v3 w=4u l=0.28u
MLP2 dn up t2 vdd pfet_03v3 w=4u l=0.28u
MLN1 up dn vss vss nfet_03v3 w=2u l=0.28u
MLN2 dn up vss vss nfet_03v3 w=2u l=0.28u
MRN up fn vss vss nfet_03v3 w=1u l=0.28u
MRP dn fp vss vss nfet_03v3 w=1u l=0.28u
* stage-1 node capacitance: limits how far the reset devices' gate coupling lifts fn/fp
CFN fn vss 10f
CFP fp vss 10f
.ends dt_comp

.subckt dt_hold up dn q vdd vss
* up rises when vinp > vinn. Equal inverters, then a NAND latch that holds while both are high (reset).
XIU up su vdd vss dt_inv
XID dn sd vdd vss dt_inv
XG1 su qb q vdd vss dt_nand2
XG2 sd q qb vdd vss dt_nand2
.ends dt_hold

.subckt flash_adc_3bit vss vdd vrefn vrefp clk vin b2 b1 b0
XCK clk ck ckb vdd vss dt_clk
RL1 t1 vrefn 400
RL2 t2 t1 400
RL3 t3 t2 400
RL4 t4 t3 400
RL5 t5 t4 400
RL6 t6 t5 400
RL7 t7 t6 400
RL8 vrefp t7 400
CT1 t1 vss 2p
CT2 t2 vss 2p
CT3 t3 vss 2p
CT4 t4 vss 2p
CT5 t5 vss 2p
CT6 t6 vss 2p
CT7 t7 vss 2p
XC1 ck ckb vin t1 u1 d1 vdd vss dt_comp
XH1 u1 d1 q1 vdd vss dt_hold
XC2 ck ckb vin t2 u2 d2 vdd vss dt_comp
XH2 u2 d2 q2 vdd vss dt_hold
XC3 ck ckb vin t3 u3 d3 vdd vss dt_comp
XH3 u3 d3 q3 vdd vss dt_hold
XC4 ck ckb vin t4 u4 d4 vdd vss dt_comp
XH4 u4 d4 q4 vdd vss dt_hold
XC5 ck ckb vin t5 u5 d5 vdd vss dt_comp
XH5 u5 d5 q5 vdd vss dt_hold
XC6 ck ckb vin t6 u6 d6 vdd vss dt_comp
XH6 u6 d6 q6 vdd vss dt_hold
XC7 ck ckb vin t7 u7 d7 vdd vss dt_comp
XH7 u7 d7 q7 vdd vss dt_hold
* one-hot, active low: h_k = !(q_k . !q_(k+1)), h7 = !q7
XN2 q2 nq2 vdd vss dt_inv
XN3 q3 nq3 vdd vss dt_inv
XN4 q4 nq4 vdd vss dt_inv
XN5 q5 nq5 vdd vss dt_inv
XN6 q6 nq6 vdd vss dt_inv
XN7 q7 h7 vdd vss dt_inv
XO1 q1 nq2 h1 vdd vss dt_nand2
XO2 q2 nq3 h2 vdd vss dt_nand2
XO3 q3 nq4 h3 vdd vss dt_nand2
XO4 q4 nq5 h4 vdd vss dt_nand2
XO5 q5 nq6 h5 vdd vss dt_nand2
XO6 q6 h7 h6 vdd vss dt_nand2
* binary: each bit is the OR of its one-hot lines, a NAND4 of the active-low lines
XB2 h4 h5 h6 h7 b2 vdd vss dt_nand4
XB1 h2 h3 h6 h7 b1 vdd vss dt_nand4
XB0 h1 h3 h5 h7 b0 vdd vss dt_nand4
.ends flash_adc_3bit
